wlanpi-mcp (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Wi-Fi packet-capture tools backed by the wlanpi-core capture
    WebSocket (/api/v1/streaming/capture): capture_scan, capture_observe,
    list_capture_sessions and get_capture_channels. Capture is consumed
    over the core WebSocket (auth-first, pcapng stream) and dissected
    locally into AP summaries; no raw pcap is returned to the client.
  * Add the wlanpi_mcp/capture/ package: an incremental pcapng reader and
    a stdlib-only radiotap/802.11 dissector vendored from wlanpi-core's
    capture_harness reference client, plus a CaptureSocket protocol driver.
  * Add the websockets runtime dependency and pin mcp[cli] to >=1.0,<2
    (mcp 2.x renames FastMCP and breaks the server).

